  "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226558/assets/6b21527790fddecf89cd72a2e1d1f67338d21d82c1f3090536be973fcd60919a.png)\n\nWe note the following:\n\n- The points in the scatter plot seem to follow a straight line with a *positive* slope. So, we have a *positive* correlation.\n\n- The points lie pretty close to the corresponding trend line. So, we have a *strong* correlation.\n\nTherefore, the variables have a *strong positive* linear correlation.",
